## Fredy

ImmoFinder is a companion UI for **Fredy** — https://github.com/orangecoding/fredy —
by Christian Kellner. Fredy does the scraping; ImmoFinder reads the database
Fredy writes and talks to Fredy's HTTP API. Fredy is **not** bundled with,
vendored into, or redistributed by this repository: `docker compose` pulls the
official image `ghcr.io/orangecoding/fredy` at runtime, and no Fredy source is
included here.

Fredy is licensed under **Apache-2.0 with a Commons Clause and an Attribution
and Naming Clause**, which makes it source-available rather than OSI open
source. If you build on Fredy itself, read its LICENSE first:
https://github.com/orangecoding/fredy/blob/master/LICENSE

### Derived file

`webui/lib/search-url.ts` contains `immoscoutWebToMobile()` and its lookup
tables, which are a TypeScript port of Fredy's `immoscout-web-translator.js`.
It exists so that the ImmoFinder job wizard can validate an ImmobilienScout24
search URL exactly the way Fredy will later scrape it, without depending on a
Fredy source checkout.

