## Data and services

ImmoFinder makes requests to third-party services at runtime:

- **OpenStreetMap / Nominatim** (https://nominatim.openstreetmap.org) for
  geocoding addresses. Map data © OpenStreetMap contributors, available under
  the Open Database License. Nominatim is a free, rate-limited community
  service — ImmoFinder honours its usage policy (one request per second, a
  descriptive User-Agent, and a hard stop on 429/5xx). Set
  `GEOCODER_USER_AGENT` to something that identifies your deployment.
- **Google Maps** is linked to for directions. No request is made server-side;
  the link only opens in the visitor's browser when they click it.
- **The listing portals** (ImmobilienScout24, Immowelt, Kleinanzeigen,
  WG-Gesucht) are contacted to check whether a listing is still online and to
  validate a search URL when creating a job. See the disclaimer in README.md.

